# A Plains Island is found by "Plains or Island card" (CR 205.3i): Flooded Strand fetches the Archive, which enters tapped (the
# fetch puts it onto the battlefield, but its own replacement effect still applies, CR 614.1c) and surveils 1 (the Island on top goes
# to the graveyard).

[Bot1 Deck]
Flooded Strand
Plains x6
Meticulous Archive
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Flooded Strand.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Flooded Strand.Activate
Bot1.Search(Meticulous Archive)
Bot1.Arrange(| Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield = Meticulous Archive
Bot1.Battlefield.Meticulous Archive.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Flooded Strand
